  "无中生有": ["他说楼下煎饼摊用地沟油，人家检验报告都贴在车上。","He claims the pancake stall uses gutter oil — the inspection reports are ON the cart.","Gutter-oil rumor, reports on the cart — nothing from birth something."],
  "恶语中伤": ["就为了一个车位，他在业主群里把人家祖宗三代骂了个遍。","Over one parking spot, he insulted the man's whole family tree in the group chat.","A parking spot, three generations insulted — evil words strike wound."],
  "含沙射影": ["她说『有些人遛狗从来不捡屎』，眼睛一直瞟着王阿姨。","She said 'some dog owners never pick it up' — staring straight at auntie Wang.","Staring at auntie Wang while saying it — hold sand shoot shadow."],
  "指桑骂槐": ["她嫌火锅太辣，却说的是『有些人做事不考虑别人』。","She wanted a milder hotpot but said 'some people never consider others'.","Wanted milder broth, said 'some people' — point mulberry curse locust."],
