  "推波助澜": ["本来只是个小误会，他把聊天记录发到网上就炸了。","It was a small misunderstanding until he posted the chat logs online.","Small misunderstanding, chat logs posted — push wave aid surge."],
  "煽风点火": ["选业委会那几天，他挨家挨户打电话挑事。","During the building-committee vote he phoned door to door stirring people up.","Door-to-door calls before the vote — fan wind light fire."],
  "避重就轻": ["问他为什么忘了接孩子，他跟我聊了一路天气。","Asked why he forgot to pick up the kid, he discussed the weather the whole way.","Forgot the pickup, discussed the weather — avoid heavy take light."],
  "文过饰非": ["蛋糕烤糊了，他说是烤箱的错、面粉的错、天气的错。","The burnt cake was the oven's fault, the flour's fault, the weather's fault.","Burnt cake blamed on oven and weather — gloss faults decorate wrongs."],
  "讳疾忌医": ["牙疼半年了，死活不肯去看牙医。","Half a year of toothache, and he absolutely refuses the dentist.","Half a year of toothache, zero dentists — hide illness fear doctor."],
  "执迷不悟": ["全家都劝他别再买彩票秘籍，他买了第十本。","The family begged him to stop buying lottery secret guides — he bought the tenth one.","Tenth lottery secret-guide purchased — cling lost not wake."],
  "死不悔改": ["偷吃被抓三次，蛋糕上贴了名字标签照偷不误。","Caught raiding the fridge three times — he still steals with a name label on the cake.","Name label on the cake, still stolen — to death not repent."],
  "顽固不化": ["全家都换智能手机了，他就说座机最好用。","Everyone upgraded to smartphones; he swears the landline is the best phone ever.","Smartphones for everyone, landline forever — stubborn hard not transform."],
  "我行我素": ["全家投票吃火锅，他自己点了汉堡外卖。","The family voted for hotpot; he ordered a burger delivery.","Hotpot vote, burger delivery — I walk I way."],
