  "刚愎自用": ["导航说左转他偏右转，结果堵了一个小时。","The GPS said left, he turned right — one hour of traffic jam.","GPS said left, he turned right — rigid willful self reliant."],
  "自以为是": ["他自己从来没养过猫，却天天指导别人怎么养猫。","He has never owned a cat — yet he coaches cat owners daily.","Never owned a cat, coaches owners daily — self think is right."],
  "贪得无厌": ["说好AA制吃饭，他回回点两个最贵的菜。","On split-bill dinners he always orders the two priciest dishes.","Split bill, priciest dishes ordered — greedy gain no full."],
  "利欲熏心": ["朋友搞到内部折扣票给他，他转手加价倒卖。","His friend got him discount tickets — he resold them at a markup.","Resold his friend's discount tickets — profit desire smoke heart."],
  "见利忘义": ["工资一涨，他立刻把合伙摆摊的兄弟挤走了。","The moment his salary rose, he pushed his street-stall partner out.","Salary rose, street-stall partner out — see profit forget righteousness."],
  "唯利是图": ["他借钱给亲戚都要先算利息。","He charges his own relatives interest on small loans.","Interest charged to his own relatives — only profit is goal."],
  "损人利己": ["旅游合照他永远站C位，还把别人挡出去。","In trip photos he always takes center and crops everyone else out.","Center of every photo, others cropped out — harm people benefit self."],
  "自私自利": ["最后一块蛋糕，他从来没让过任何人。","The last slice of cake has never once been offered to anyone.","The last slice, never offered — self private self profit."],
