  "口是心非": ["他嘴上说最讨厌甜食，蛋糕店里一周碰见他三回。","He claims to hate desserts — yet you run into him at the bakery weekly.","Hates desserts, spotted at the bakery — mouth yes heart no."],
  "言而无信": ["说好轮流请奶茶，轮到他三次了他都装没听见。","We alternate bubble-tea rounds — it has been his turn three times now.","Three bubble-tea rounds skipped — speak yet no trust."],
  "背信弃义": ["合伙开店，他半路带走配方自己隔壁又开了一家。","Mid-partnership he took the recipe and opened his own shop next door.","Took the recipe, opened next door — betray trust abandon righteousness."],
  "卖友求荣": ["为了当班长，他把好朋友迟到的事报告了老师。","To become class monitor, he reported his best friend's tardiness to the teacher.","Best friend reported for a badge — sell friends seek glory."],
  "数典忘祖": ["在城里发了财，回村嫌老宅的门牌丢人。","Got rich in the city and now finds the old family gate embarrassing.","The old family gate now 'embarrassing' — recite canon forget ancestors."],
