  "衣冠禽兽": ["西装革履地去参加义卖，顺手把义卖品拿回了家。","Suited up for the charity sale — and pocketed the charity goods.","Pocketed the charity-sale goods — robes cap beast animal."],
  "人面兽心": ["对老人赔着笑脸献殷勤，转头哄人家拿养老钱买保健品。","Sweet-talks the elderly, then talks them out of their pension for fake supplements.","Sweet to elders, sells them fake cures — human face beast heart."],
  "狼子野心": ["他免费帮所有邻居修电脑，原来是为了收集大家的账号密码。","He fixed every neighbor's computer for free — to collect all their passwords.","Free repairs, passwords collected — wolf cub wild heart."],
  "心狠手辣": ["打牌时搭档出错了张牌，他直接把人家的牌掀了。","His partner played one wrong card — he flipped the whole hand over.","One misplay, whole hand flipped — heart cruel hand vicious."],
